### Setting a backup_type_code
The `backup_type_code` attribute in the config can be optionally set by the user. If not set in the config, the provider will compute the appropriate `backup_type_code` based on the instance set by the user for the `instance_id` attribute.

If a specific, different `backup_type_code` is required, the API endpoint `/api/backups/types` will list all available Backup Types. The `hpe_morpheus_backup_type` data source can be used to fetch a code for a Backup Type given a name or ID.

{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Import

Import is supported using the resource ID.

```bash
terraform import hpe_morpheus_backup_instance.example 123
```
